\begin_layout Standard
The keyword 
\family typewriter
solid
\family default
 marks the beginning of a set of facets (i.e.
 triangles) that form a 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

solid
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 in an STL file and the keyword 
\family typewriter
endsolid
\family default
 marks its end.
 Between beginning and ending line, the facets (begins with 
\family typewriter
facet
\family default
 and ends with 
\family typewriter
endfaced
\family default
) are defined in the form of an facet-individual 
\begin_inset Formula $xyz$
\end_inset

